        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(f) All qualified groundman, groundman truck-drivers, and operators who are members of Local Union 51 prior to 03/01/99 will not be replaced by lineman on crews if they are available on the out of work list. Should groundman, groundman truck-drivers, and operators become unemployed they will be put to work on existing crews if positions are available.",
